WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.980
Student Council

00:00:05.010 --> 00:00:06.270
I don't remember telling 
you to come here.

00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:09.840
I have business with you.

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:13.150
Kurenai Gekkou-dono, We have thrice requested that you immediately deliver a report on the witch Saitohimea and the victim Kurogane Taito. Any further disregard of orders will be considered an act of rebellion and the 
Miyasaka High School student council president, Kurenai Gekkou, will be taken into custody. We hope that you make a decision that is worthy of your position and fulfills your duty. You have three days to deliver the report.

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:16.120
I've been doing some thinking.

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:18.570
I don't want Himea to be sad anymore.

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:21.810
That's why I want enough 
power to protect her.

00:00:23.030 --> 00:00:24.950
After all of your failures

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:28.500
and the trouble you've made 
for Saitohimea and myself,

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:32.640
you better make yourself useful, 
or else you're just scum.

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:34.930
You have a point...

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:39.480
So you wish to struggle 
like the trash you are?

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:42.270
You're a jerk, you know?

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:44.010
I'm merely stating the facts.

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:45.080
Really?

00:00:45.370 --> 00:00:46.090
Yes.

00:00:48.410 --> 00:00:49.530
Oh.

00:00:49.530 --> 00:00:51.870
But you see...

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:55.230
I feel like struggling for a bit.

00:00:58.630 --> 00:01:03.730
Well, you have an advantage with 
that durable body of yours.

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:08.580
Open.

00:01:11.750 --> 00:01:14.350
Go meet with the lord inside.

00:01:14.350 --> 00:01:18.230
If you pay the right price, he will 
grant pretty much any request.

00:01:18.770 --> 00:01:20.640
It's that easy?

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.130
This is the fastest way

00:01:24.130 --> 00:01:26.060
for scum to become strong.

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:28.040
Yeah, yeah, Mr. Genius.

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:30.310
Thanks awfully.

00:01:30.310 --> 00:01:30.840
See ya.

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:31.890
Good-bye.

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:34.110
Try not to die.

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:11.610
y=x^2+2x+c

00:03:11.610 --> 00:03:15.470
(-2≤x≤2)

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:15.090
This part is important!!

00:03:15.470 --> 00:03:17.540
Solve for the greatest possible value.

00:03:17.540 --> 00:03:20.120
The student council is really busy.

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:24.720
"The Pop-Quizzing New Teacher"

00:03:25.610 --> 00:03:28.500
I wish class would be over sooner...

00:03:30.950 --> 00:03:32.400
Next is gym!

00:03:32.800 --> 00:03:34.440
I get to see Taito!

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:37.710
Time to leave my special seat!

00:03:47.510 --> 00:03:51.720
Gekkou said something 
about paying a price...

00:03:51.720 --> 00:03:53.330
What am I supposed to give up?

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:56.980
Money? I don't have any.

00:03:56.980 --> 00:03:59.120
What is your wish?

00:04:04.850 --> 00:04:06.860
Are you the lord of this place?

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:13.620
I am Edelka.

00:04:14.470 --> 00:04:17.010
The one who controls 
the scales of desire.

00:04:17.640 --> 00:04:20.220
The one who determines 
the value of a wish.

00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:22.930
Hear me out, Edelka!

00:04:23.420 --> 00:04:26.060
I came here for power!

00:04:29.980 --> 00:04:31.510
What do you want me to draw?

00:04:31.510 --> 00:04:32.680
Whatever you want.

00:04:33.850 --> 00:04:35.400
So I can draw Bu-chan-man?

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:37.290
Don't ask me.

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:45.930
Regarding the report...

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:47.190
Any further disregard 
of orders will be...

00:04:47.190 --> 00:04:50.010
I don't want Himea to be sad anymore.

00:04:50.010 --> 00:04:53.330
That's why I want enough 
power to protect her.

00:04:57.600 --> 00:05:03.870
The question is whether he is 
capable of wielding that power.

00:05:05.930 --> 00:05:09.380
I will grant you whatever 
power you seek.

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:10.990
Really?

00:05:10.990 --> 00:05:16.910
In return, I will extract 
whatever price I deem suitable.

00:05:17.240 --> 00:05:18.380
Price...

00:05:20.410 --> 00:05:22.770
Perhaps I should take part of your body.

00:05:22.770 --> 00:05:26.970
Or a precious memory... Your 
hopes and dreams will also do.

00:05:29.540 --> 00:05:35.690
Last time, I took from a greedy king 
the lives of all of his subjects.

00:05:35.960 --> 00:05:40.590
Now, join me in the ring of death!

00:06:04.160 --> 00:06:05.300
Me?

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:11.340
Oh, my. Are you a vampire?

00:06:11.340 --> 00:06:14.370
What a stupendous guest.

00:06:15.280 --> 00:06:17.170
Are you the lord of this place?

00:06:17.570 --> 00:06:19.510
What is your wish?

00:06:20.370 --> 00:06:24.860
I want you to bring Taito back to life.

00:06:26.570 --> 00:06:29.810
A human? It will cost you.

00:06:29.810 --> 00:06:36.080
The life of a mere human still 
demands a high price to restore.

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:37.730
I know.

00:06:40.150 --> 00:06:42.530
No hesitation at all.

00:06:42.530 --> 00:06:45.330
Is his life so important?

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:46.590
Uh-huh.

00:06:47.580 --> 00:06:49.640
He's very important.

00:06:49.640 --> 00:06:53.350
I'll pay any price you ask.

00:06:53.740 --> 00:06:56.660
I see. Very well.

00:06:56.660 --> 00:06:58.610
Then I shall restore

00:06:58.610 --> 00:07:00.840
that human's life.

00:07:01.160 --> 00:07:02.320
Thank you.

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:05.820
Himea!

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:11.190
No!

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:24.860
Himea!

00:07:34.660 --> 00:07:37.140
Taito isn't here...

00:07:44.530 --> 00:07:47.510
Himea!

00:08:07.010 --> 00:08:09.960
So I really did die...

00:08:13.500 --> 00:08:15.400
And Himea paid a price to save me...

00:08:16.910 --> 00:08:19.790
Yes, her magic was magnificent.

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:25.150
She offered me most of her magic 
to save the life of a puny human.

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:27.150
Such a stupid vampire.

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:29.970
What? Watch your mouth!

00:08:29.970 --> 00:08:32.070
Himea isn't stupid!

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:33.580
Really?

00:08:33.580 --> 00:08:34.570
Yeah!

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:36.830
Prove it to me then.

00:08:37.110 --> 00:08:42.080
Offer me all you have. Tell me 
that you wish to protect her.

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:45.080
I will extract the appropriate price.

00:08:47.900 --> 00:08:50.750
I want enough power to protect Himea!

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:53.470
I will grant that wish.

00:08:53.470 --> 00:08:56.860
But I want to protect 
her with my own power.

00:08:57.110 --> 00:09:00.760
So I refuse to beg for more power!

00:09:00.760 --> 00:09:02.450
That was the approach 
I took with karate!

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:05.630
I have no problem with having 
to work hard to become stronger!

00:09:05.630 --> 00:09:07.350
That's my wish!

00:09:08.490 --> 00:09:09.730
How boring.

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:22.110
If you assumed that the price for 
that wish wouldn't be as steep,

00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:24.060
you are mistaken.

00:09:25.350 --> 00:09:27.380
I will take what is important to you

00:09:27.380 --> 00:09:31.380
and place it on one side of the 
scale in the ring of death.

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:33.390
So I can find something of equal value.

00:09:42.340 --> 00:09:44.210
Wh-What?!

00:09:44.210 --> 00:09:45.980
I have given you information

00:09:45.980 --> 00:09:49.470
that will be useful and information 
that will be useless.

00:09:49.890 --> 00:09:52.100
You enjoy hard work, yes?

00:09:52.100 --> 00:09:53.900
Search long and hard then.

00:09:58.060 --> 00:09:59.580
That's...

00:09:59.580 --> 00:10:04.410
Yes, the price you paid for that wish.

00:10:05.840 --> 00:10:08.170
What did I lose?

00:10:10.340 --> 00:10:12.570
See for yourself.

00:10:12.570 --> 00:10:14.250
That you have lost

00:10:14.940 --> 00:10:17.950
something very important...

00:10:18.810 --> 00:10:20.840
Something very important...

00:10:22.360 --> 00:10:23.650
Himea!

00:10:23.650 --> 00:10:25.910
Return to your original world.

00:10:31.640 --> 00:10:33.190
Ah, Hime-chan.

00:10:33.890 --> 00:10:35.150
Where's Taito?

00:10:35.640 --> 00:10:37.660
The immortal guy went out.

00:10:37.660 --> 00:10:41.540
Does your mouth exist to reveal information 
that's supposed to remain hidden?

00:10:44.660 --> 00:10:48.910
Just kidding! He didn't go to see 
Edelka or anything like that.

00:10:49.190 --> 00:10:51.200
You're a hopeless idiot.

00:10:52.790 --> 00:10:54.110
Edelka?!

00:10:58.260 --> 00:11:01.240
That means he knows...

00:11:01.240 --> 00:11:03.510
You couldn't hide it from him forever.

00:11:03.510 --> 00:11:04.640
But...

00:11:07.490 --> 00:11:10.220
Ow...

00:11:10.220 --> 00:11:12.540
I think I broke something...

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:14.290
Himea!

00:11:14.760 --> 00:11:15.770
Taito!

00:11:19.200 --> 00:11:22.370
Himea... I'm glad to see you...

00:11:22.370 --> 00:11:23.880
Any luck?

00:11:23.880 --> 00:11:25.700
Yeah, I guess...

00:11:26.240 --> 00:11:28.850
I suppose you'll be more useful now.

00:11:28.850 --> 00:11:32.250
No, a slave that's leveled 
up is still a slave.

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:34.010
What was that?!

00:11:34.010 --> 00:11:35.470
Taito...

00:11:41.320 --> 00:11:45.010
It's good to know that you're okay.

00:11:45.010 --> 00:11:47.600
You're the one I'm worried about.

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:49.420
I'm fine.

00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:53.450
She took something from me, but 
nothing's wrong or anything.

00:11:53.710 --> 00:11:56.020
I guess it worked out in the end...

00:11:56.470 --> 00:12:00.290
If you were to die again,

00:12:01.000 --> 00:12:02.830
I don't know what I would do...

00:12:02.830 --> 00:12:06.440
Don't push yourself too 
hard for my sake...

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:11.130
You did the same thing when 
you asked Edelka to help me.

00:12:12.070 --> 00:12:14.350
I know why I'm still alive now.

00:12:14.350 --> 00:12:17.310
You had to bail me out again.

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:20.350
Don't say that...

00:12:21.110 --> 00:12:22.180
Remember?

00:12:22.660 --> 00:12:25.970
I said that I wanted to become 
strong enough to protect you.

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:28.520
That's why I went to see Edelka.

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:34.370
You try to do everything yourself.

00:12:36.030 --> 00:12:36.860
Taito...

00:12:39.760 --> 00:12:42.360
From now on, let me share that burden.

00:12:43.220 --> 00:12:44.300
But...

00:12:44.870 --> 00:12:47.380
If we work together, it 
won't be as difficult.

00:12:47.820 --> 00:12:50.290
I know we can do this.

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:51.850
Taito...

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:56.890
Okay, then. Let's go on a treasure hunt.

00:12:56.890 --> 00:12:58.360
Treasure hunt?

00:12:58.740 --> 00:13:01.790
To find what I'm going 
to need to protect you.

00:13:01.790 --> 00:13:03.360
I'm coming with you!

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:06.470
Taito, you're the one who said

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:09.140
that it won't be as difficult 
if we work together.

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:12.830
So the search will go 
faster if I come with you.

00:13:19.410 --> 00:13:22.190
That's true. Let's go, Himea.

00:13:22.910 --> 00:13:23.940
Uh-huh!

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:30.340
Area scan complete.

00:13:30.810 --> 00:13:33.510
Linking to locations 
which fit the criteria.

00:13:40.550 --> 00:13:42.890
Can't we use Gekkou's holy land?

00:13:42.890 --> 00:13:44.770
We can try,

00:13:44.770 --> 00:13:47.180
but the lord can be demanding at times.

00:13:47.180 --> 00:13:49.130
And I wouldn't be surprised

00:13:49.130 --> 00:13:52.020
if the place was booby-trapped, 
given his nasty personality.

00:13:52.020 --> 00:13:54.050
They might even be lethal.

00:13:57.160 --> 00:13:58.160
Huh?

00:13:58.160 --> 00:13:59.370
There's nothing here.

00:13:59.800 --> 00:14:03.360
Come on. A navigational error already?

00:14:09.100 --> 00:14:10.040
Rain?

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:26.180
Damn, this one's wrong.

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:28.840
Area scan complete.

00:14:35.770 --> 00:14:37.390
Saved...

00:14:37.640 --> 00:14:40.190
This won't be easy.

00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:42.160
Area scan complete.

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:45.000
Alto!

00:14:45.600 --> 00:14:46.770
Thanks!

00:14:55.740 --> 00:14:57.450
I took notes for you.

00:14:57.450 --> 00:14:59.320
Thanks!

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:03.430
Man, childhood friends are the best.

00:15:05.520 --> 00:15:06.900
This is good!

00:15:06.900 --> 00:15:08.760
Really? I'm happy to hear that.

00:15:09.570 --> 00:15:15.330
Huh? But I have a feeling that I 
usually didn't eat Haruka's lunches...

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:20.720
You can slow down.

00:15:23.450 --> 00:15:27.490
I'm starving since I've been 
on the move all morning.

00:15:27.490 --> 00:15:29.720
The student council must be busy.

00:15:34.090 --> 00:15:38.760
When will Kurogane-kun introduce me?

00:15:39.180 --> 00:15:41.640
Afternoon classes have started.

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:45.080
What's wrong?

00:15:46.790 --> 00:15:49.580
Oh, I'm feeling a little 
under the weather...

00:15:49.580 --> 00:15:53.020
In that case, shouldn't you 
be in the nurse's office?

00:15:53.880 --> 00:15:55.010
You have a point...

00:15:55.500 --> 00:15:58.250
Huh? Shouldn't you be in class, Teach?

00:15:59.300 --> 00:16:03.150
I get it. You're already 
sick of the place.

00:16:03.150 --> 00:16:05.960
Since this school's so strange.

00:16:05.960 --> 00:16:06.650
Strange?

00:16:08.610 --> 00:16:12.010
The other day, there was a 
student running around on fire.

00:16:12.010 --> 00:16:14.610
But there wasn't a scratch on him.

00:16:15.090 --> 00:16:17.370
Is that what passes for a 
ghost story at this school?

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:20.260
Not exactly...

00:16:20.260 --> 00:16:22.460
You have a wonderful imagination.

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:24.370
Let me know when you have 
another story to tell me.

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:30.670
That's right! Teach, did you recommend 
me to the student council?

00:16:31.270 --> 00:16:33.620
Yes, I'll take care of it.

00:16:41.130 --> 00:16:43.780
Did Kurogane Taito die?

00:16:44.370 --> 00:16:47.000
He should be fine since 
Hime-chan's with him.

00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:48.680
I wonder what they'll find.

00:16:48.680 --> 00:16:52.580
The Sword of Uriel? The Rage 
of the Ancients spell?

00:16:52.580 --> 00:16:54.450
Perun the Lightning Familiar?

00:16:55.050 --> 00:16:57.570
A slave is meant to be 
armed with a cypress rod.

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:00.370
We're back!

00:17:01.340 --> 00:17:03.360
Oh, now this brings back memories.

00:17:03.360 --> 00:17:04.850
Who are you, old guy?

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:07.920
Ah, I apologize for letting myself in

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:09.410
while you were gone.

00:17:09.980 --> 00:17:11.920
I am the new English teacher.

00:17:12.700 --> 00:17:15.610
My name is Kurosu Firiel Yuuichi.

00:17:15.900 --> 00:17:19.500
And I'm not that old.

00:17:19.500 --> 00:17:20.910
Nice to meet ya!

00:17:20.910 --> 00:17:22.770
A new teacher?

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:26.730
You don't know who I am?

00:17:27.250 --> 00:17:29.900
Your work with the student 
council is important,

00:17:29.900 --> 00:17:34.040
but you should stay up-to-date with 
what's going on in this school,

00:17:34.040 --> 00:17:35.150
Mr. President.

00:17:35.460 --> 00:17:37.600
If you want to be 
treated like a teacher,

00:17:37.600 --> 00:17:40.810
you should lose those ludicrous threads.

00:17:40.810 --> 00:17:42.780
You don't like suits?

00:17:42.780 --> 00:17:45.690
But you'll have to wear them one day.

00:17:46.090 --> 00:17:48.110
All grown-ups wear them.

00:17:48.510 --> 00:17:49.750
Who sent you?

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:52.520
You're quick.

00:17:52.870 --> 00:17:56.690
I'm an administrator who was 
sent by the military brass.

00:17:59.180 --> 00:18:02.400
Let's narrow down the criteria 
before we run the next scan.

00:18:07.070 --> 00:18:08.810
Resource error.

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:12.390
Overload has caused a meltdown 
in the caster's brain.

00:18:17.110 --> 00:18:18.150
Taito?!

00:18:26.340 --> 00:18:31.230
Your brain wasn't able to process 
the incredible amount of data.

00:18:31.230 --> 00:18:33.270
And my brain had a meltdown as a result?

00:18:33.270 --> 00:18:35.900
Man, Edelka should have 
warned me about this.

00:18:35.900 --> 00:18:39.720
If I didn't have the power to 
come back to life, I'd be dead.

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:42.720
And I keep dying every 
time we follow a lead.

00:18:43.630 --> 00:18:48.800
But it was worth the effort. Since 
we found that crazy monster.

00:18:49.240 --> 00:18:51.230
Vishob Eleranka.

00:18:51.640 --> 00:18:53.630
You know that thing?

00:18:58.890 --> 00:19:00.090
This is where...

00:19:04.290 --> 00:19:05.240
A cage?

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:06.640
I remember now...

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:07.510
Huh?

00:19:07.980 --> 00:19:12.130
Vishob Eleranka was sealed 
away in the Blance Labyrinth.

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:15.250
What?! So we're inside its prison?!

00:19:16.110 --> 00:19:18.630
It was locked up for the crime

00:19:18.630 --> 00:19:21.630
of destroying seven Alga

00:19:21.940 --> 00:19:24.260
when it was still the 
familiar of Fenolz.

00:19:24.560 --> 00:19:26.520
Sounds promising!

00:19:26.520 --> 00:19:28.510
I'll make it mine!

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:33.100
Some fools have wandered into my prison.

00:19:33.100 --> 00:19:36.770
I will consume your bodies.

00:19:36.770 --> 00:19:37.780
Nonsense!

00:19:40.780 --> 00:19:44.180
I'll grab you by the neck and 
collar you into a contract!

00:19:44.180 --> 00:19:46.010
You are but a mere human!

00:19:47.180 --> 00:19:49.540
What?! Sa-Saitohimea?!

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:55.530
A cat?

00:19:56.450 --> 00:19:57.920
It's dead?

00:20:07.280 --> 00:20:09.310
See? I warned n-you.

00:20:12.410 --> 00:20:13.810
That's one death.

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:16.020
Are n-you immortal?!

00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:17.000
Yep.

00:20:17.000 --> 00:20:19.180
Interesting.

00:20:19.180 --> 00:20:21.620
You're pretty interesting yourself.

00:20:21.620 --> 00:20:22.820
N-You think?

00:20:22.820 --> 00:20:25.570
Contract made.

00:20:25.570 --> 00:20:28.070
I'll give you three liters 
of my blood every day.

00:20:28.070 --> 00:20:30.200
Hmm, guess I don't really have a choice.

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:32.430
I'll serve n-you.

00:20:32.430 --> 00:20:34.040
Isn't that great, Taito?

00:20:35.070 --> 00:20:35.960
We'll be counting on your help.

00:20:36.600 --> 00:20:37.960
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:20:38.350 --> 00:20:41.530
How come you're so nice to her?

00:20:41.530 --> 00:20:46.590
She is one of the ancient magicians. 
The vampire Saitohimea-sama.

00:20:46.590 --> 00:20:48.390
N-You're just a human.

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:49.750
You're like the dirt on her shoes.

00:20:49.750 --> 00:20:53.520
I agreed to a contract with 
n-you because that was her wish.

00:20:53.890 --> 00:20:55.390
Hey...

00:20:55.390 --> 00:20:58.310
You look like a normal cat to me.

00:20:58.310 --> 00:21:00.070
Do you really have any power?

00:21:00.400 --> 00:21:04.070
I simply channel magic 
energy to my master.

00:21:04.630 --> 00:21:06.570
It doesn't matter how I look.

00:21:06.570 --> 00:21:09.200
Is that how it works?

00:21:09.570 --> 00:21:10.700
Bye.

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:13.150
Hey! Where are you going?

00:21:13.400 --> 00:21:17.150
I will appear whenever 
n-you need to use my power.

00:21:17.460 --> 00:21:19.630
Heh, is that how it works?

00:21:19.630 --> 00:21:21.150
That's how it works.

00:21:22.180 --> 00:21:25.180
See ya, Vishob Eleranka.

00:21:26.620 --> 00:21:28.830
That's a really long name.

00:21:29.800 --> 00:21:32.110
Okay! I'll call it Meowka!

00:21:32.110 --> 00:21:34.310
That's not my name!

00:21:34.310 --> 00:21:35.870
It's a pleasure to be 
working with you, Meowka.

00:21:37.750 --> 00:21:39.610
Yes, ma'am! The pleasure is all mine!

00:21:42.180 --> 00:21:44.680
Wh-What's so funny?!

00:21:45.610 --> 00:21:47.970
Stop that, human! N-You 
don't get to laugh!

00:21:49.620 --> 00:21:52.120
Student Council

00:21:52.400 --> 00:21:56.620
The military has repeatedly 
asked that you write a report

00:21:56.620 --> 00:21:59.830
on the Seraphim incident that 
transpired a few days ago.

00:22:02.340 --> 00:22:04.050
You should follow orders.

00:22:04.360 --> 00:22:06.980
Damage was kept to a minimum 
because of my presence.

00:22:06.980 --> 00:22:08.720
You incompetents should 
stay out of my affairs.

00:22:10.480 --> 00:22:11.890
Incompetents, you say?

00:22:18.650 --> 00:22:20.100
And you're dead.

00:22:20.100 --> 00:22:21.280
Damn!

00:22:22.230 --> 00:22:23.270
No way!

00:22:34.770 --> 00:22:37.090
That won't work against me.

00:24:10.390 --> 00:24:11.970
Hey, Taito.

00:24:11.970 --> 00:24:13.000
It's so hot during summer,

00:24:13.000 --> 00:24:16.760
so why do humans go to the 
beach where it's even hotter?

00:24:16.760 --> 00:24:20.070
That's because you can have 
a lot of fun at the beach.

00:24:20.070 --> 00:24:21.000
Any examples?

00:24:21.000 --> 00:24:22.480
Swimsuits...

00:24:22.480 --> 00:24:24.600
Watermelon splitting and fireworks.

00:24:24.600 --> 00:24:25.980
And swimsuits!

00:24:25.980 --> 00:24:28.140
Taito, you must really like swimsuits.

00:24:28.140 --> 00:24:29.810
Well, I am a man.

00:24:29.810 --> 00:24:34.520
Then, then... Um... Would you 
be happy if I wore a swimsuit?

00:24:34.520 --> 00:24:35.670
Huh? Uh...

00:24:35.030 --> 00:24:39.980
Next Time "The Student Council of Remedial Students"

00:24:35.670 --> 00:24:37.740
Okay! I'll use my magic to change!

00:24:37.740 --> 00:24:39.470
Wait! Himea?!
